      "side": 1,
      "message": "Only ForceUpdate interacts with it. A forced component the FD still declines is recorded as Failed. Without this change, applyComplete cleared that before activation and the device was reported successful. CancelUpdate isn\u0027t affected, since nothing was applied before it. The \"any Accepted → activate\" checks still hold, because components are updated one at a time.\n\nChecking this also found that cancelUpdateComponent() still cleared the map before activation, so a device whose last component was cancelled after a failed apply was reported as successful. Fixed in ps12, with a unit test (CancelledComponentFailsDeviceDespiteAnotherSucceeding) that failed before the fix.",
